{"id":"850f86d5448feae4","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-definability.md","title":"标准模型中全部基础真句集的可定义性","display":"df-truth-definability — 标准模型中全部基础真句集的可定义性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-definability","aliases":["91-df-truth-definability"],"display":"df-truth-definability — 标准模型中全部基础真句集的可定义性","depends_on":["[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-definability — 标准模型中全部基础真句集的可定义性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce2e952933d30cc2\" href=\"?note=ce2e952933d30cc2\" title=\"91-df-expressive-completeness\">91-df-expressive-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ce2e952933d30cc2\" href=\"?note=ce2e952933d30cc2\" title=\"91-df-expressive-completeness\">91-df-expressive-completeness</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau)\\)</span>（也写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}\">\\(\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N=\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathcal N=\\mathbb N\\)</span>）是下述全域性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本定义在非句子代码上要求假；若只要求标准句子上的 T-双条件，可给候选公式加基础句子守卫后取得全域版本。Tarski 对角论证排除这两种版本。\n这是外部语义可定义性，另一个一致理论逐个证明候选双条件是不同的证明论性质。使用新原始谓词公理化真理也不等于旧算术语言中的显式定义。</p>\n<p>来源：§2、§4；Theorem 7.4 及其对角证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-expressive-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-expressive-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb N$ 与 $\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}$ 采用 [[91-df-expressive-completeness]]；$\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathcal N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{DefinesTruth}_{\\mathbb N}(\\tau)\\coloneqq\n\\forall a\\in\\mathbb N\\,[\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(\\overline a)\\leftrightarrow a\\in\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N}].","display":true}],"bytes":1395,"backlinks":[{"id":"c289f1c721012496","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-definability]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\